      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "for any technology to be successful there are some certain number of questions that we can ask\nif ans is yes then that technology is succesful\n\n1 Does it solve real world problems? -> yes like it is solving customer support problems are many more\n2 Is it useful on a daily basis -> yes\n3 Is it impacting the world economics? -> yes\n4 Is it creating new jobs -> yes\n5 Is it accessible -> yes we can use these tools very easily by talking in our language\n\nsince all of these question, has answer yes it will be going to be successfull",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "for any technology to be successful there are some certain number of questions that we can ask\nif ans is yes then that technology is succesful\n\n1 Does it solve real world problems? -> yes like it is solving customer support problems are many more\n2 Is it useful on a daily basis -> yes\n3 Is it impacting the world economics? -> yes\n4 Is it creating new jobs -> yes\n5 Is it accessible -> yes we can use these tools very easily by talking in our language\n\nsince all of these question, has answer yes it will be going to be successfull",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
